#: ../../reference_manual/tools/comic_panel_editing_tool.rst:15
msgid "Comic Panel Editing Tool"
msgstr "Nástroj na úpravu komiksových panelov"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/comic_panel_editing_tool.rst:17
msgid "|toolcomicpanelediting|"
msgstr "|toolcomicpanelediting|"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/comic_panel_editing_tool.rst:19
msgid ""
"The Comic Panel Editing Tool allows the user to create comic panels by "
"either slicing through shapes and adding a gutter in between the resulting "
"halves, or merging the shapes by removing the gaps."
msgstr ""
"Nástroj na úpravu komiksových panelov umožňuje používateľovi vytvárať "
"komiksové panely buď rozrezaním tvarov a pridaním medzery medzi výsledné "
"polovice, alebo zlúčením tvarov odstránením medzier."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/comic_panel_editing_tool.rst:23
msgid "Tool Options"
msgstr "Možnosti nástroja"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/comic_panel_editing_tool.rst:26
msgid "Cutting mode"
msgstr "Režim rezania"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/comic_panel_editing_tool.rst:28
msgid "|toolcomicpanelediting_cutting|"
msgstr "|toolcomicpanelediting_cutting|"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/comic_panel_editing_tool.rst:30
msgid ""
"This mode allows you to cut through shapes and create gaps (gutters) of a "
"specified width."
msgstr ""
"Tento režim umožňuje prerezávať tvary a vytvárať medzery (oddeľovače) "
"zadanej šírky."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/comic_panel_editing_tool.rst:32
msgid ""
"Note: you need to first create a vector layer, and on a vector layer create "
"the initial shape. For example, for a classic comic, use the :ref:"
"`rectangle_tool` on a vector layer for the rectangle encompassing all panels."
msgstr ""
"Poznámka: najprv musíte vytvoriť vektorovú vrstvu a na nej počiatočný tvar. "
"Napríklad pri klasickom komikse použite nástroj :ref:`rectangle_tool` na "
"vektorovej vrstve pre obdĺžnik ohraničujúci všetky panely."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/comic_panel_editing_tool.rst:34
msgid ""
"To create a gap between shapes, press and drag, until the line crosses all "
"the shapes you want to cut through."
msgstr ""
"Ak chcete vytvoriť medzeru medzi tvarmi, stlačte a ťahajte, kým čiara "
"neprekríži všetky tvary, cez ktoré chcete rezať."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/comic_panel_editing_tool.rst:37
msgid "Unit of width"
msgstr "Jednotka šírky"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/comic_panel_editing_tool.rst:38
msgid "Defines the unit of width used for the presets below."
msgstr "Definuje jednotku šírky používanú pre predvoľby nižšie."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/comic_panel_editing_tool.rst:39
msgid "Thick Gap, Thin Gap, Special Gap"
msgstr "Hrubá medzera, Tenká medzera, Špeciálna medzera"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/comic_panel_editing_tool.rst:40
msgid "Three presets for your three most used gap widths."
msgstr "Tri predvoľby pre vaše tri najpoužívanejšie šírky medzier."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/comic_panel_editing_tool.rst:42
msgid ""
"This option allows Krita to select the most appropriate gap width preset "
"based on the angle of the line."
msgstr ""
"Táto možnosť umožňuje Krita automaticky vybrať najvhodnejšiu predvoľbu šírky "
"medzery na základe uhla čiary."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/comic_panel_editing_tool.rst:45
msgid ""
"In :guilabel:`Automatic` mode, if the angle between the line and a perfectly "
"horizontal line is smaller than the :guilabel:`Angle`, use the preset "
"specified by :guilabel:`Horizontal`; if the angle between the line and a "
"perfectly vertical line is smaller than the :guilabel:`Angle`, use the "
"preset specified by :guilabel:`Vertical`; otherwise, use the preset "
"specified by :guilabel:`Diagonal`."
msgstr ""
"V režime :guilabel:`Automatic` platí: ak je uhol medzi čiarou a dokonale "
"vodorovnou čiarou menší ako :guilabel:`Angle`, použije sa predvoľba určená "
"položkou :guilabel:`Horizontal`; ak je uhol medzi čiarou a dokonale zvislou "
"čiarou menší ako :guilabel:`Angle`, použije sa predvoľba určená položkou :"
"guilabel:`Vertical`; inak sa použije predvoľba určená položkou :guilabel:"
"`Diagonal`."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/comic_panel_editing_tool.rst:46
msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "Automatický"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/comic_panel_editing_tool.rst:46
msgid "Horizontal, Vertical, Diagonal, Angle"
msgstr "Vodorovný, Zvislý, Uhlopriečny, Uhol"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/comic_panel_editing_tool.rst:49
msgid "Merging mode"
msgstr "Režim spájania"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/comic_panel_editing_tool.rst:51
msgid "|toolcomicpanelediting_merging|"
msgstr "|toolcomicpanelediting_merging|"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/comic_panel_editing_tool.rst:53
msgid "Remove the gutter between shapes."
msgstr "Odstráni medzeru medzi tvarmi."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/comic_panel_editing_tool.rst:55
msgid ""
"To remove the gap, press on one side of the gap, drag and release on the "
"other side of the gap. Note that you can only remove one gap at a time, and "
"the gap removing line must cross exactly two shape edges for it to work "
"correctly."
msgstr ""
"Ak chcete odstrániť medzeru, stlačte na jednej strane medzery, potiahnite a "
"uvoľnite na druhej strane. Upozorňujeme, že naraz možno odstrániť iba jednu "
"medzeru a čiara na odstraňovanie medzery musí prechádzať presne dvoma "
"hranami tvaru, aby fungovala správne."
